# Public endpoint for the contact form, e.g. a Formspree form ID URL
# (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx) or a Resend/EmailJS/Supabase Edge
# Function endpoint that accepts form submissions. This must be a PUBLIC
# endpoint only — never put a private/service-role API key here or in any
# other frontend file.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
